1
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:59,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you for attending today's briefing. The briefing on the fiscal year 2027 proposed expenditure program of the Department of Public Works and Highways is hereby called to order. The Chair would like to acknowledge the presence of our Senate President

2
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:26,110
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: who is here with us this morning. Likewise Senator Imee Marcos and Senator Lacson were also here this morning, but there's an ongoing JBC hearing, so they'll be joining us shortly. At this juncture, the Chair recognizes our Committee Secretary to acknowledge our resource persons present for today.

3
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:59,980
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good morning. Good morning also to our Senate President. For the briefing on the proposed FY 2027 budget of the Department of Public Works and Highways, we'd like to acknowledge our resource persons. From the DPWH, we have Secretary Vivencio Dizon, Undersecretary Emil Sadain, Undersecretary Ricardo Bernabe, Undersecretary Ador Canlas, OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse Esquibil, Undersecretary Nicasio Conti, Undersecretary Samuel Turgano, Undersecretary Rio Espiritu, Undersecretary Charles Kalima Jr.

4
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:29,980
Committee Secretary: Assistant Secretary Carlo Jaujaro Castro, Assistant Secretary Suzanne Marie Liwanag, Assistant Secretary Michelle de Vera, Assistant Secretary Melody Ann Covillar, Assistant Secretary Angelo Nuestro, Director Dana Beatriz Millan, Director Alexander Belderol, Director Allan Borromeo, Director Richelle Yu Felipe Lim, Director Toribio Noel L. Ilao, Director Jumar Tablando, and Regional Directors who are present via Zoom.

5
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:41,760
Committee Secretary: From the DBM, we have Director Maria Cecilia Socorro Abogado, Ms. Cheryl Magluyan, Ms. Chania Edna Tapan, Ms. Glidel Kim Sevilla, and Mr. John Leo Visaya.

6
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:51,780
Committee Secretary: From COA, we have Director Tracy Ann Zunico, Mr. Siegfried Apolinares, Attorney Jefferson Roma, and Ms. Journey Camargo-Gapero.

7
00:19:52,020 --> 00:19:52,840
Committee Secretary: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

8
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Comsec.

9
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:59,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The Chair would like to acknowledge, of course, the presence of our colleagues.

10
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senators Bongo and Senator I.B. Marcos.

11
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:07,700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Now, before we move on, the Chair would like to read this opening statement.

12
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:13,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good morning to our colleagues in government, our resource persons, and everyone present today.

13
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:19,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Today, we deliberate on the proposed 2027 budget of the Department of Public Works and Highways,

14
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:23,180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: one of the government's most important implementing agencies.

15
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:29,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The DPWH plays a crucial role not only in building roads, bridges, flood control systems,

16
00:20:29,340 --> 00:20:29,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and other public

17
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: infrastructure,

18
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:32,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but also driving economic growth.

19
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:39,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Infrastructure spending has a significant multiplier effect on the economy,

20
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:46,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: creating jobs, improving connectivity, attracting investments, and stimulating economic activity.

21
00:20:47,620 --> 00:20:53,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As demonstrated by developed countries, infrastructure deserves as the backbone of a strong economy,

22
00:20:54,700 --> 00:20:59,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: opening up opportunities, and ultimately improving the quality of lives of our people.

23
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: During the recent DBCC briefing,

24
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:12,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: DEPDev reported that infrastructure spending averaged around 5.8% of GDP from 2022 to 2024,

25
00:21:12,760 --> 00:21:17,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but dropped significantly to around 4.7% in 2025.

26
00:21:19,260 --> 00:21:23,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And at present, 2026 is much even worse.

27
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Second quarter is only 2% GDP.

28
00:21:27,380 --> 00:21:28,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: DepDEP also identified,

29
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:35,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: underspending and delays in project implementation as risks to achieving our growth targets.

30
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:44,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This comes amid a sharp 32.2% contraction in public construction for the first half of 2026,

31
00:21:44,780 --> 00:21:50,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: raising serious concerns about the pace of infrastructure development and its impact on economic growth.

32
00:21:52,020 --> 00:21:59,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Noong nakaraang taon, naging sentro ng kontrobersya ang DPWH dahil sa mga anomalya sa flood control projects.

33
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:05,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It is one of, if not the largest, corruption scandal in the history of our country.

34
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:13,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Noong sumalbulat po ito, mistulang tumigil ang lahat, at nauunawaan po natin ito.

35
00:22:14,280 --> 00:22:19,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sometimes we need to pause for a while, rethink and rectify the errors before once again moving forward.

36
00:22:20,380 --> 00:22:25,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The flood control corruption scandal should be treated as a temporary speed bump.

37
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:29,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We acknowledge the filing of cases in the name of accountability,

38
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tunay po na dapat na may managot,

39
00:22:32,620 --> 00:22:39,140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ngunit hindi po dapat maging dahilan ang kontrobersya upang tuluyan natin ihinto ang infrastructure development.

40
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:43,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang dapat po natin gawin ay mas maging mapagmatsyag,

41
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:49,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: bantayan natin ang kabanang bayan at tiyakin na mapupunta ito sa tama.

42
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:58,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The promises of infrastructure development can only be achieved and felt if we become more cautious and aware of certain red flags.

43
00:22:58,920 --> 00:22:59,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They must be achieved.

44
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:03,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They must be addressed and seriously dealt with.

45
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:11,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But also, again, we'd like to emphasize that we give importance to accountability more than anything.

46
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:22,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang mga talagang may sangkot, ang mga may sala ay dapat panagutin at talagang dapat po ay talagang hindi natularan at hindi na maulit-mulit.

47
00:23:22,980 --> 00:23:26,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We acknowledge the reforms that the good secretary tried instituting,

48
00:23:26,940 --> 00:23:29,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: like requiring certificates of importance.

49
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:30,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Implementability,

50
00:23:31,780 --> 00:23:34,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ensuring ready program of works,

51
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:38,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: signing and others in the 2027 NEP.

52
00:23:38,900 --> 00:23:43,200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero good secretary, sa aming pong initial review ng ilang DPWG projects,

53
00:23:43,780 --> 00:23:50,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: napansin namin ang tila ilang questionable items pa rin na ipagpapalagay natin na red flags.

54
00:23:51,120 --> 00:23:55,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Una, sa 1,256 projects sa ilalim ng flood management program,

55
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:59,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 155 projects na may allocation na abot sa 8.2

56
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:05,060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: billion ang kulang o hindi nakapag-comply sa requirements ng iyong ahensya.

57
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:10,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pangalawa, may mga budgetary items na ang tanging description ay various projects.

58
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:18,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ikatlo, may mga lump sum items na wala lang malinaw na detalye para sa implementasyon.

59
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:21,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mayroon ding mga clustered projects.

60
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:27,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At panghuli, may ilan pang nawawala o inconsistent ang project limits.

61
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Walang petsa o cost ng mga nasabing proyekto.

62
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:39,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So yes, we need to boost our infrastructure spending but not the expense of the reforms we want to be instituted.

63
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:45,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sinipulan po ang reforma sa budget ng naupo bilang chairman ng Committee on Finance

64
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:48,920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang ating pong Senate President Wingachelya noong isa taon

65
00:24:48,920 --> 00:24:53,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at balak po natin ipagpatuloy ang reformang kanya pong nasimulan.

66
00:24:54,340 --> 00:24:57,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Every delayed project has an economic cost

67
00:24:57,220 --> 00:24:59,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and every anomalous poorly vetted project

68
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: costs us even more.

69
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:06,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It wastes taxpayers' money, deprives endangered communities of safety,

70
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:08,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and erodes public trust.

71
00:25:09,380 --> 00:25:12,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa kabila ng lahat ng mga nangyayaring issue na may kaugnayan

72
00:25:12,560 --> 00:25:15,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa maanumalyang flood control at ghost projects,

73
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:19,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mas lalo lamang tumingkad ang pangangailangan natin

74
00:25:19,020 --> 00:25:23,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para sa isang comprehensive master plan para sa infrastruktura.

75
00:25:24,020 --> 00:25:28,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Habang hinihintay po natin ang pagpasa ng ating panukalang master plan

76
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:31,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for Infrastructure and National Development or MIND Act,

77
00:25:32,380 --> 00:25:36,020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: dapat ay ngayon pa lamang ay basiguro natin na naayon na rin ito

78
00:25:36,020 --> 00:25:37,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa proposed budget ng DPWH.

79
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:43,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we deliberate, our goal is clear.

80
00:25:43,560 --> 00:25:46,420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Restore the momentum of infrastructure spending

81
00:25:46,420 --> 00:25:51,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: while eliminating the efficiencies, irregularities, and anomalies

82
00:25:51,080 --> 00:25:53,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that have undermined public trust.

83
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:58,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kailangan natin ibalik ang tiwala ng ating pong mamamahal

84
00:25:58,240 --> 00:26:04,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ng taong bayan sa ating gobyerno at tigit sa lahat sa ating budget process.

85
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:09,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We need to strike a balance for this budget season.

86
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:15,240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We need to give utmost priority and importance to accountability

87
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:18,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: but at the same time, we need to accelerate public spending

88
00:26:18,760 --> 00:26:21,260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to improve our economic growth.

89
00:26:22,220 --> 00:26:23,040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Maraming salamat po.

90
00:26:24,320 --> 00:26:28,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Before we continue, the Chair would like to ask,

91
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:30,640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: our Senate President, if he has any opening statement,

92
00:26:30,860 --> 00:26:32,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: then probably our colleagues.

93
00:26:33,460 --> 00:26:34,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

94
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:36,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Maraming salamat po.

95
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:45,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Natandaan ko po last year nung nagkaroon tayo ng hearing sa DPWH budget.

96
00:26:46,740 --> 00:26:49,740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kakaupo lang po ni Secretary Vince Dison at that time.

97
00:26:51,540 --> 00:26:56,980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At natatandaan ko po parang nawala po sa kanya, parang 50 pounds.

98
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:02,160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Tapos yung buhok niya, parang hindi ko ma-describe.

99
00:27:02,340 --> 00:27:08,120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero ngayon, at least naka-gel na at meron na ho siyang Amerikana.

100
00:27:08,740 --> 00:27:12,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kaya nakakahinga na ho siya ngayon at medyo tumaba-taba na rin.

101
00:27:13,220 --> 00:27:14,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Para tumanda ng 20 years eh.

102
00:27:15,060 --> 00:27:18,040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ngayon, ano na lang, 10 years na lang.

103
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:20,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But having said that, kidding aside,

104
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:26,040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nagpapasalamat po ako kay Secretary Vince because over the last one year,

105
00:27:26,700 --> 00:27:28,040
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: katulad po ng sinabi,

106
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:32,820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sabi ninyo, Mr. Chairman, maraming reforma ang nakita ho natin sa DPWH.

107
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:43,200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At marami ho tayong nakita ang mga basics na inilagay niya para po hindi na maulit yung nakita natin noong 2025.

108
00:27:45,080 --> 00:27:52,300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Importante dito yung paggagawa ng master plan at feasibility study na pinakita nyo sa inyong slide ho kanina.

109
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:55,240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Napakahalaga ho yan dahil yan po yung kulang last time.

110
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:58,240
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At isa rin pong impulsiyon.

111
00:27:58,240 --> 00:28:11,200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Importante na nakita kong aksyon na ginawa po ng DPWH sa pumumunan po ni Secretary Dizon ay yung sinasabing yung madalas dapat panagutin yung dapat managot.

112
00:28:12,060 --> 00:28:20,540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At nakita ho natin marami pong mga politiko, mga even DPWH people na nakulong at nakasuhan.

113
00:28:20,540 --> 00:28:27,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At ito ay napakahalaga dahil isa, mahalaga po yung reforma pero mahalaga yung accountability.

114
00:28:27,520 --> 00:28:31,380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At mapanagot natin para hindi ho ito naulit, mauulit.

115
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:35,500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Isang dahilan ho kaya nauulit to dahil walang natatakot eh.

116
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:37,880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Walang nakukulong, walang nagiging accountable.

117
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:46,980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero from top to bottom, from politiko all the way to the bureaucracy, nakita ho natin na marami hong nakulong at ngayon ay kinakasuhan.

118
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:56,480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At nagpapasalamat po ako sa DPWH at under the leadership of Secretary Dizon dahil nga ho nagpursige at naglakas ng loob.

119
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,480
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Political will.

120
00:28:57,520 --> 00:29:02,820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Para po magkaroon ng panadukutan sa loob po ng DPWH.

121
00:29:03,840 --> 00:29:07,420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: May papakita lang po akong a few slides, Helena.

122
00:29:07,640 --> 00:29:12,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At nasabi na rin to ng ating chairman na talagang bumagal po ang ating ekonomiya.

123
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:23,540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In the last 10 years outside of the pandemic, ito na yung pinakamabagal ho nating economic growth na nakita at 2.6% in the first half.

124
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:27,500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And if you look at the reasons, next slide.

125
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:37,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ang pinakamalaking dahilan dito ay number one, bumagal po yung government construction at number two, bumagal yung household consumption.

126
00:29:38,860 --> 00:29:46,100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In household consumption, may kaugnayan yan sa mataas na presyo ng bilihin or inflation.

127
00:29:46,620 --> 00:29:52,460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero in government construction, ito po ay directang connectado doon sa flood control issue natin.

128
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:57,460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So gusto rin natin marinig ngayon sa DPWH kung ano po yung...

129
00:29:57,520 --> 00:30:00,000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nagawa na this second half of

130
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the year para po pabilisin

131
00:30:01,940 --> 00:30:04,280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung pag-gastos

132
00:30:04,280 --> 00:30:05,820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: natin sa mga infrastructure

133
00:30:05,820 --> 00:30:07,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: projects. Ang low-hanging fruit

134
00:30:07,860 --> 00:30:10,060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: po para mapabilis po yung ating ekonomiya

135
00:30:10,060 --> 00:30:12,160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ay pabilisin rin yung construction,

136
00:30:12,740 --> 00:30:13,920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: pabilisin yung implementation

137
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ng project without sacrificing

138
00:30:15,980 --> 00:30:17,260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: integrity,

139
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:19,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: accountability, and of course

140
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: the right price.

141
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:23,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hindi ibig sabihin na pababilisin

142
00:30:23,720 --> 00:30:24,780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: natin yung construction,

143
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:27,960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: babalik tayo sa dating gawin

144
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:30,080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na sino-sino na lang

145
00:30:30,080 --> 00:30:31,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang binibigyan ng kontrata kahit na

146
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:33,920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: overpriced. So, importante

147
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na pabilisin yung implementation

148
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ng project, pero yung reforma

149
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:39,900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na naumpisahan na po ng DPWH

150
00:30:39,900 --> 00:30:41,700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: under the leadership ni Secretary Dizon,

151
00:30:41,800 --> 00:30:43,220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: eh hindi ho mapuputulho yan.

152
00:30:43,940 --> 00:30:44,140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So,

153
