DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh, pinigit na po namin pasimulan yung pagpasaayos nung sa Manay.

8923
05:49:49,720 --> 05:49:54,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: If you're pertaining po to the hospital or the municipal hall, I think.

8924
05:49:54,460 --> 05:49:56,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Basta yung mga pinangako nyo po.

8925
