DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will double-check po and we will make sure na maayos po.

8928
05:50:00,280 --> 05:50:05,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, Sec Beans, as the country experiences a series of typhoons,

8929
05:50:05,180 --> 05:50:11,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ito pong earthquake, lalo na itong pagbabaha dito sa Luzon

8930
05:50:11,080 --> 05:50:15,380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: that have caused severe and widespread flooding in many areas.

8931
05:50:15,480 --> 05:50:17,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako mismo, pinupuntahan ko talaga yun.

8932
05:50:18,020 --> 05:50:22,280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mampanga, Bulacan, naawa talaga ako sa Pilipino.

8933
05:50:22,380 --> 05:50:25,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam mo yun, ikaw mismo, hands-on ka eh.

8934
05:50:26,360 --> 05:50:28,640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa ka sa hardworking na mga sekretaris.

8935
05:50:28,900 --> 05:50:30,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pinupuntahan mo talaga yung mga nababahan.

8936
05:50:31,300 --> 05:50:33,380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Magkasama tayo noon sa pag-iikot.

8937
05:50:33,900 --> 05:50:40,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sumisikip yung dibdib mo makita na until now, hindi pa rin nagsusubside yung baha.

8938
05:50:41,220 --> 05:50:44,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sumisigaw sila ng tulong, na nangailangan ng tulong.

8939
05:50:44,120 --> 05:50:45,220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tulungan nyo naman po sila.

8940
05:50:45,220 --> 05:50:47,160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kayo pong nandyan sa Executive Department,

8941
05:50:47,640 --> 05:50:51,740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pakiuna na lang po na ma-address itong problema ng flooding po.

8942
05:50:52,020 --> 05:50:52,860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kawawa talaga.

8943
05:50:53,520 --> 05:50:56,140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yung iba po, naiiwan sa mga evacuation.

8944
05:50:56,360 --> 05:50:57,620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba po, naiiwan sa mga evacuation centers.

8945
05:50:58,580 --> 05:50:59,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba, skwelahan.

8946
05:51:01,260 --> 05:51:03,840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Skwelahan, gym, hindi sila komportable.

8947
05:51:03,980 --> 05:51:05,780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung iba, walang maayos na sanitation.

8948
05:51:06,700 --> 05:51:10,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong mga pamilya na napipilitang lumikas at nawawala ng tirahan.

8949
05:51:11,400 --> 05:51:16,400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This highlights the urgent need to ensure the safety and welfare of affected communities.

8950
05:51:17,180 --> 05:51:20,780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nabanggit po ito ng Pangulo, SecBins, ito pong sa SONA.

8951
05:51:21,200 --> 05:51:25,860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Banggit po ito ni Pangulo, yung mga evacuation center or ito pong ligtas.

8952
05:51:26,360 --> 05:51:27,400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pinoy Centers Act.

8953
05:51:27,960 --> 05:51:31,160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bilang principal author at co-sponsor ng batas na ito,

8954
05:51:31,280 --> 05:51:36,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ito pong Republic Act 12076 or the Ligtas Pinoy Centers Act,

8955
05:51:36,080 --> 05:51:43,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: which mandates the establishment of evacuation centers in every city and municipality nationwide.

8956
05:51:44,320 --> 05:51:49,600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nais ko lang pong malaman sa DPWH ang estado sa pagpapatayo ng mga evacuation centers sa bansa

8957
05:51:49,600 --> 05:51:56,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa 1.2 trillion na budget po sa flood control from 2022 to 2025.

8958
05:51:56,360 --> 05:52:01,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 2025 na alam naman natin na sayang po sa flood control.

8959
05:52:01,400 --> 05:52:07,140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang katumbas po nito ay 60,000 evacuation centers na sana pong naipatayo.

8960
05:52:07,880 --> 05:52:13,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung hindi po ito na sayang sa korupsyon o itong sa flood control controversy.

8961
05:52:14,580 --> 05:52:21,360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: SecBins, marahil pakisilip naman po na sana mabigyan nyo po ng prioridad itong mga evacuation centers.

8962
05:52:22,360 --> 05:52:24,320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mapapakinabangan po ito ng mga kababayan natin.

8963
05:52:24,320 --> 05:52:25,440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Batas na po ito eh.

8964
05:52:26,360 --> 05:52:32,300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nabanggit po ng Pangulo sa kanyang SONA na bibigyan niya po ito ng prioridad.

8965
05:52:32,920 --> 05:52:38,160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At marami po sa budget ng 2025 or 2026 na mga evacuation centers,

8966
05:52:39,000 --> 05:52:44,400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: baka ma-recommend nyo na po na magamit, mapakinabangan.

8967
05:52:44,820 --> 05:52:47,200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gamit na gamit po ito sa mga evacuees.

8968
05:52:47,960 --> 05:52:48,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking tulong po ito.

8969
05:52:48,940 --> 05:52:55,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since batas naman po ito at kayo naman po ang titingin kung ano po yung dapat at pangangailangan ng lugar na yon.

8970
05:52:56,360 --> 05:52:59,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Under the 2027 budget,

8971
05:53:00,160 --> 05:53:08,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: 180 million is allocated for construction of evacuation centers per region or 3 billion in total.

8972
05:53:09,980 --> 05:53:12,980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Saan ho ba ito itatayo, SecBins?

8973
05:53:13,640 --> 05:53:17,060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At maaaring pakisilip na lang din, ibangga nyo na lang po sa data ninyo.

8974
05:53:17,060 --> 05:53:24,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maaaring may mga evacuation center or multipurpose building na nasa 2025 at 2026

8975
05:53:24,880 --> 05:53:26,060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para mapakinabangan.

8976
05:53:26,360 --> 05:53:27,520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mapakinabangan naman po, kaagad.

8977
05:53:28,560 --> 05:53:31,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi na natin antayin na umabot pa ng 2027.

8978
05:53:32,620 --> 05:53:33,840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes, Mr. Chairman.

8979
05:53:34,040 --> 05:53:37,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Actually po, just to update the Honorable Senator,

8980
05:53:38,220 --> 05:53:40,500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: as of end of August this year,

8981
05:53:41,220 --> 05:53:47,720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 464 na po out of the 492 evacuation center projects under Ligtas Pinoy

8982
05:53:47,720 --> 05:53:55,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang completed na po, 24 po ang undergoing construction na, ongoing na po,

8983
05:53:55,480 --> 05:54:05,020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 4 po ang reconstruction pa lang at 3 po e unimplementable dahil po at sa area nila.

8984
05:54:06,080 --> 05:54:17,400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa 2027 budget naman po, meron po tayong 3.06 billion na dalawang evacuation centers kada region.

8985
05:54:18,680 --> 05:54:25,260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi ko lang po masagot pa kung saan ito dahil ang OCD po ang magdedetermine ito.

8986
05:54:25,260 --> 05:54:29,280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At hindi pa po nila sinasabi sa amin kung ano ang mga locations nito.

8987
05:54:29,700 --> 05:54:32,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But we will report immediately, Mr. Chairman, kung saan po ito.

8988
05:54:33,080 --> 05:54:35,380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po, mabigyan nyo po ito ng prioridad.

8989
05:54:35,520 --> 05:54:38,080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will prioritize, Mr. Chairman. You have our assurances.

8990
05:54:38,080 --> 05:54:44,260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since batas naman po ito, Sec. Vince, singit ko lang po about health facilities.

8991
05:54:45,140 --> 05:54:47,760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, kahit na hindi ka pa sekretary nito,

8992
05:54:47,760 --> 05:54:55,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: itong 2024 at 2025 ga mandated DPWH to implement health infrastructure,

8993
05:54:55,100 --> 05:54:58,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: exceeding 5 million under the HPEP.

8994
05:55:00,080 --> 05:55:03,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po yung nagkaproblema kasi pag more than 5 million,

8995
05:55:04,920 --> 05:55:08,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ang sinasagot ng DOH ay DPWH ang magtatrabaho.

8996
05:55:08,960 --> 05:55:12,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So nagkakos po ng delays po ito.

8997
05:55:12,860 --> 05:55:16,160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sayang naman po itong mga proposed health facilities,

8998
05:55:16,860 --> 05:55:19,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: specially funded in 2025.

8999
05:55:20,700 --> 05:55:22,480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong mga reports ng delay.

9000
05:55:25,100 --> 05:55:30,240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi ko nga na kung nagtutulungan lang po ang DOH at siyang LGU.

9001
05:55:30,320 --> 05:55:34,920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong LGU na gustong mapatayuan rin po sila ng mga health facilities nila.

9002
05:55:36,040 --> 05:55:41,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngunit sa delays, 2 to 3 years pa minsan napapatayo.

9003
05:55:41,320 --> 05:55:43,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ilang pasyente po sanang pwedeng matulungan.

9004
05:55:43,680 --> 05:55:46,960
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakisilip na lang po nito, Sec. Vince.

9005
05:55:47,480 --> 05:55:51,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming LGUs na gusto pong magkaroon ng sariling health facilities.

9006
05:55:51,540 --> 05:55:53,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na sa mga malalayong lugar.

9007
05:55:55,100 --> 05:55:58,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Remember, we are more than 7,000 islands sa buong Pilipinas.

9008
05:55:58,680 --> 05:56:04,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming mga isla na gusto rin pong magkaroon ng sarili nilang mga super health center or mga health center.

9009
05:56:05,460 --> 05:56:09,920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yun pong mga reklamo nating naririnig na hindi pa po na-implement

9010
05:56:09,920 --> 05:56:12,640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: dahil more than 5 million po itong mga proyekto.

9011
05:56:13,220 --> 05:56:17,900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi ko, pag nagtulungan ng LGU, nagtulungan ng DPWH or ang DOH,

9012
05:56:18,560 --> 05:56:21,860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mapapakinabangan ka agad itong mga proyektong ito.

9013
05:56:23,040 --> 05:56:23,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And also,

9014
05:56:25,100 --> 05:56:27,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: may answer po ito sa health facilities.

9015
05:56:27,220 --> 05:56:29,140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact po, Mr. Chairman,

9016
05:56:29,660 --> 05:56:32,640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nakitagpulong po kami very recently with our new Health Secretary,

9017
05:56:32,780 --> 05:56:34,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Secretary Edwin Mercado.

9018
05:56:34,580 --> 05:56:36,980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And we will provide po a catch-up plan

9019
05:56:36,980 --> 05:56:42,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: for you and the committee po on the health facilities enhancement program.

9020
05:56:43,960 --> 05:56:44,620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Secretary Vince,

9021
05:56:44,760 --> 05:56:51,140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: malalala mo na isa ka sa nagtayo nung

9022
05:56:51,140 --> 05:56:54,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: itong sa facility sa Clarksville.

9023
05:56:55,400 --> 05:56:58,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: When you were still the BCDA chairperson.

9024
05:56:59,580 --> 05:57:03,320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At napakaganda po itong naging skwelahan na ngayon.

9025
05:57:03,560 --> 05:57:06,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung pinatayo ng SEA Games na NAS, no?

9026
05:57:07,000 --> 05:57:10,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Before naging NAS yan, yung pasilidad dyan,

9027
05:57:10,640 --> 05:57:13,440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pinatayo ng BCDA through SecVins.

9028
05:57:13,500 --> 05:57:15,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napakaganda po, napapakinabangan,

9029
05:57:15,400 --> 05:57:19,220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and naging number one pa tayo nung 2019 SEA Games.

9030
05:57:19,360 --> 05:57:21,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Congratulations sa ating lahat.

9031
05:57:21,760 --> 05:57:24,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At napuntahan ko rin po, napakaganda ng mga pasilidad,

9032
05:57:24,180 --> 05:57:26,240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: napapakinabangan ng mga atleta natin.

9033
05:57:26,660 --> 05:57:28,300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At ngayon, ginawa nating skwelahan,

9034
05:57:28,500 --> 05:57:29,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ginawa nating batas.

9035
05:57:30,120 --> 05:57:33,740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa po ako sa author at ko-sponsor dito.

9036
05:57:34,300 --> 05:57:37,060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Principally sponsored po yun ng Senate President ngayon,

9037
05:57:37,140 --> 05:57:38,600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na si Senator Wyn Gatchal yan.

9038
05:57:40,180 --> 05:57:42,360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami na po mga atletang nakikinabang.

9039
05:57:42,600 --> 05:57:45,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I hope that DPWH also could consider the repair

9040
05:57:45,660 --> 05:57:48,300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and rehabilitation of sports facilities.

9041
05:57:48,540 --> 05:57:49,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po ang napapansin ko,

9042
05:57:49,700 --> 05:57:53,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na lilimutan po yung pagbibigay ng prioridad

9043
05:57:53,040 --> 05:57:54,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa ating mga sports facilities.

9044
05:57:54,180 --> 05:57:58,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaysa mapunta po yung budget sa corruption

9045
05:57:58,700 --> 05:58:02,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o sa flood control projects sa lugar naman po na walang tao,

9046
05:58:02,180 --> 05:58:05,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sana po'y mabigyan niyo rin po ng prioridad

9047
05:58:05,180 --> 05:58:10,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: itong budget po ng mga sports facilities.

9048
05:58:10,180 --> 05:58:12,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sekwins, tingnan niyong mabuti.

9049
05:58:12,180 --> 05:58:15,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Taon-taon, napakaliit po ng ina-appropriate.

9050
05:58:15,180 --> 05:58:21,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung baga sa pay, sa 7 trillion na pondo po ng gobyerno,

9051
05:58:21,180 --> 05:58:24,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: parang icing lang yung pondo ng sports facilities.

9052
05:58:24,180 --> 05:58:27,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: P.S.C.O. ng sports.

9053
05:58:27,180 --> 05:58:30,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sila po'y nagmamakawa na ito,

9054
05:58:30,180 --> 05:58:34,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: may tulo na yung Philippine Sports Commission,

9055
05:58:34,180 --> 05:58:38,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung dating Ultra, yung Field Sports, yung RMC,

9056
05:58:38,180 --> 05:58:40,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Rizal Memorial Complex.

9057
05:58:40,180 --> 05:58:44,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako nga mismo, bilang chairperson ng sports,

9058
05:58:44,180 --> 05:58:48,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: isinulong natin noong 2024, 2023,

9059
05:58:48,180 --> 05:58:52,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na ma-repair yung RMC, ma-repair yung Field Sports.

9060
05:58:52,180 --> 05:58:53,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Habang naglalaro ka,

9061
05:58:53,180 --> 05:58:55,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: may tulo na minsan.

9062
05:58:55,180 --> 05:58:58,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po'y komportable naman po ang ating mga atleta.

9063
05:58:58,180 --> 05:59:03,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sila po nagbibigay sa atin ng karangalan tuwing may mga sporting events sa ating bansa.

9064
05:59:03,180 --> 05:59:05,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Katulad ngayon sa Asian Games.

9065
05:59:05,180 --> 05:59:08,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat wala pong ibang iniisip ang mga atleta,

9066
05:59:08,180 --> 05:59:13,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kundi to focus on their game sa kanilang training.

9067
05:59:13,180 --> 05:59:15,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat supportado sila ng gobyerno.

9068
05:59:15,180 --> 05:59:18,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana naman po, mabigyan niyo po ito ng prioridad.

9069
05:59:18,180 --> 05:59:21,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since isa ka po sa talagang nagpaganda ng atleta,

9070
05:59:21,180 --> 05:59:25,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nagpaganda ng New Clark City,

9071
05:59:25,180 --> 05:59:28,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o ito pong inyong proyekto sa BCDA.

9072
05:59:28,180 --> 05:59:32,180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Since nasa DPWH ka, kindly po.

9073
05:59:32,180 --> 05:59:38,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, actually, tuloy-tuloy po ang supporta namin kay Chairman Gregorio.

9074
05:59:38,180 --> 05:59:43,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung pong mga repairs natin sa Rizal, sa Ultra,

9075
05:59:43,180 --> 05:59:44,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ginagawa po natin yan.

9076
05:59:44,180 --> 05:59:47,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pati po yung mga dormitories ng atletas.

9077
05:59:47,180 --> 05:59:49,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lalo na sa Ultra, napakaganda na po ngayon.

9078
05:59:49,180 --> 05:59:50,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tama po kayo.

9079
05:59:50,180 --> 05:59:52,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Our athletes need more support.

9080
05:59:52,180 --> 05:59:57,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tututukan din po namin yan sa mga darating na buwan po.

9081
05:59:57,180 --> 05:59:59,180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mga gago na po, marami tayo.

9082
06:00:00,000 --> 06:00:05,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung i-host ng mga sporting events in the coming years, in the coming months.

9083
06:00:06,300 --> 06:00:09,360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Coordinated po kami very closely with Chairman Pato

9084
06:00:09,360 --> 06:00:12,780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po tuloy-tuloy ang paayos natin ng mga facilities.

9085
06:00:12,960 --> 06:00:15,840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pati yung swimming pool sa UP Mindanao

9086
06:00:15,840 --> 06:00:20,920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: or maaari yung soccer field rin po matulungan nyo.

9087
06:00:21,180 --> 06:00:25,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May tanong lang po ko, Sec Vins, about itong sa budget ng DPWH.

9088
06:00:25,440 --> 06:00:27,700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Inaasan nyo ba sa PSC yung mga infrastructure

9089
06:00:27,700 --> 06:00:30,040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o meron rin kayo ang nagpapagawa?

9090
06:00:32,120 --> 06:00:36,000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang DBM po for this year, for 2027,

9091
06:00:36,620 --> 06:00:44,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinanggal po ng DBM sa DPWH yung mga convergence budgets.

9092
06:00:45,140 --> 06:00:48,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, kagaya po ng pinag-iwanag po kanina,

9093
06:00:48,880 --> 06:00:52,540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung sa DOT, yung sa DTI, sa DOTR,

9094
06:00:52,960 --> 06:00:54,660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasama na rin po yung sa PSC.

9095
06:00:54,980 --> 06:00:57,560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ang ano po nila, ipinasok na po nila yan

9096
06:00:57,680 --> 06:01:03,120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sa mother agency, in this case, for sports facilities, sa PSC.

9097
06:01:03,540 --> 06:01:06,480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tumituri naman po ang aming cooperation ng PSC.

9098
06:01:07,120 --> 06:01:10,040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kung kakikanganin po nila kami sa DPWH,

9099
06:01:10,340 --> 06:01:11,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ready po kaming tumulong sa kanila.

9100
06:01:12,980 --> 06:01:16,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, ibig sabihin, tinanggal sa inyong.

9101
06:01:18,040 --> 06:01:19,020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sayang naman.

9102
06:01:20,180 --> 06:01:23,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana manggagaling sa DPWH yung pondo.

9103
06:01:24,580 --> 06:01:27,160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mapapakinabangan po ng mga atleta natin ito.

9104
06:01:27,680 --> 06:01:34,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, another question na itong sa building code,

9105
06:01:34,740 --> 06:01:35,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: disaster preparedness.

9106
06:01:36,660 --> 06:01:39,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, I filed the proposed new building code

9107
06:01:39,560 --> 06:01:42,640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: which aims to protect the people's lives

9108
06:01:42,640 --> 06:01:44,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and mitigate the impact of disasters

9109
06:01:44,540 --> 06:01:47,480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: by setting standards and benchmarks

9110
06:01:47,480 --> 06:01:50,260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: that all buildings and infrastructures

9111
06:01:50,260 --> 06:01:53,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: must meet with particularly the recommended

9112
06:01:53,580 --> 06:01:55,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: structural stability and integrity

9113
06:01:55,680 --> 06:01:57,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: designed to withstand disasters

9114
06:01:57,680 --> 06:01:59,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and to prevent the spread of natural disasters.

9115
06:01:59,680 --> 06:02:01,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ilang dekada na po nakalipas itong building code natin,

9116
06:02:01,680 --> 06:02:03,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: o yung national building code.

9117
06:02:03,680 --> 06:02:05,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Naipasa po ito noong 1977.

9118
06:02:05,680 --> 06:02:09,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami na po nagbago sa panahon ngayon

9119
06:02:09,680 --> 06:02:11,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at marami na tayong natutunan tungkol sa building safety

9120
06:02:11,680 --> 06:02:17,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: dahil po sa makabagong teknolohiya or siyensya, rather.

9121
06:02:17,680 --> 06:02:19,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Makabagong siyensya.

9122
06:02:19,680 --> 06:02:21,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Panahon na po upang pag-aralan natin at pag-a-update po

9123
06:02:21,680 --> 06:02:23,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ng national building code.

9124
06:02:23,680 --> 06:02:26,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaki po ang gagampanan ng DPWH para masiguro na ligtas.

9125
06:02:27,680 --> 06:02:31,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang ating infrastruktura.

9126
06:02:31,680 --> 06:02:37,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Priority nyo ba ito?

9127
06:02:37,680 --> 06:02:41,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, meron po kaming current technical working group

9128
06:02:41,680 --> 06:02:43,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na nagre-review ng buong building code.

9129
06:02:43,680 --> 06:02:48,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Lumang-luma na po ito. Mayigit 20 taon na or

9130
06:02:48,680 --> 06:02:51,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 50 years na pala. Sorry.

9131
06:02:51,680 --> 06:02:53,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 50 years na po next year ito.

9132
06:02:53,680 --> 06:02:56,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po dapat na po tagalain.

9133
06:02:56,680 --> 06:03:02,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po, Sen. Bong, for your initiative na talagang i-review na ito.

9134
06:03:02,680 --> 06:03:07,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang co-chairs po nung aming review committee ay si Undersecretary Conti

9135
06:03:07,680 --> 06:03:10,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at si Undersecretary Izquibil for Technical Services.

9136
06:03:10,680 --> 06:03:15,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Siguro po, maiksing update lang po kay, from USEC, Conti

9137
06:03:15,680 --> 06:03:18,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and then maybe a few updates from USEC, Lara.

9138
06:03:18,680 --> 06:03:22,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Thank you, Secretary. Magandang habon po, Sen. Bong Go.

9139
06:03:22,680 --> 06:03:24,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Nag-issue po si Secretary Vince ng Special Order No.

9140
06:03:24,680 --> 06:03:27,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: 155.

9141
06:03:27,680 --> 06:03:31,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Talaga nga po siya na magkaroon ng review committee.

9142
06:03:31,680 --> 06:03:35,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: At para sa kaalaman po ng ating kagalanggalang ni Sen. Bong Go,

9143
06:03:35,680 --> 06:03:38,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: dalawang beses po nagkakaroon ng meeting

9144
06:03:38,680 --> 06:03:41,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: ang kada buwan ang aming committee.

9145
06:03:41,680 --> 06:03:44,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: At sa loob po ng dalawang linggo ay matatapos na po namin

9146
06:03:44,680 --> 06:03:46,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: yung aming mga proposed amendments.

9147
06:03:46,680 --> 06:03:49,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Kasama rin po at na-consider po, Sen. Bong Go,

9148
06:03:49,680 --> 06:03:52,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: yung mga provision po doon sa inyong panukalang batas din po.

9149
06:03:52,680 --> 06:03:56,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: At target nga po namin next week, first week po ng October,

9150
06:03:56,680 --> 06:04:01,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: ay ma-finalize na po namin ang resulta ng review committee

9151
06:04:01,680 --> 06:04:05,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: dahil hinahabol nga po namin, Mr. Chairman, Sen. Bong Go,

9152
06:04:05,680 --> 06:04:10,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: na by February of 2027, that is the 50th anniversary po

9153
06:04:10,680 --> 06:04:12,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: ng ating National Building Code.

9154
06:04:12,680 --> 06:04:16,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: So sana po mahabol ito at who knows, very timely po

9155
06:04:16,680 --> 06:04:21,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: na ma-firmahan po yung batas sapagkat sinabi naman po ng ating presidente ito nung SONA,

9156
06:04:21,680 --> 06:04:25,680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: na itibigyan ng urgent attention po.

9157
06:04:25,680 --> 06:04:30,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po. Tandaan niyo lang yung golden anniversary ng building code

9158
06:04:30,680 --> 06:04:33,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para ma-update na po ito.

9159
06:04:33,680 --> 06:04:39,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Before my last question, Sec. Vince.

9160
06:04:39,680 --> 06:04:47,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sen. Tom, I think si Usec Lara po. Kasi siya po yung technical director.

9161
06:04:47,680 --> 06:04:50,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Siya po yung magaling na engineer na batang bata.

9162
06:04:51,680 --> 06:04:52,680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ano po?

9163
06:04:52,680 --> 06:04:57,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Sen. We just wanted to say na the Department of Public Works and Highways

9164
06:04:57,680 --> 06:05:00,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: is working with the Association of Structural Engineers of the Philippines

9165
06:05:00,680 --> 06:05:03,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: and we're updating the National Structural Code of the Philippines.

9166
06:05:03,680 --> 06:05:08,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: Nandito na po sa DP and it incorporates the updated seismic maps and the wind map.

9167
06:05:08,680 --> 06:05:12,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: So this is updating with the current conditions po

9168
06:05:12,680 --> 06:05:16,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: and the higher probability of exceedance po sa ating earthquake and typhoons.

9169
06:05:16,680 --> 06:05:20,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: So yun po yung malaking tulong po para pag nagde-design po tayo,

9170
06:05:20,680 --> 06:05:28,680
DPWH OIC Undersecretary Lara Marisse I. Esquibil: eh yung mga recorded, highest recorded and yung mga mataas na probability na po ang nakakonsider.

9171
06:05:28,680 --> 06:05:36,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko talaga Usec, Sec. Vince, sa mga nasira ng lindol.

9172
06:05:36,680 --> 06:05:43,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun talaga yung mga old structures para hindi na nila kinaya.

9173
06:05:43,680 --> 06:05:49,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So doon sa Region 12, nung nakaraang lindol, yun talagang napansin natin.

9174
06:05:49,680 --> 06:05:53,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And I'm sure mas alam niyo po yun, lalong-lalo na po yung mga engineer.

9175
06:05:53,680 --> 06:05:57,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And before my last question or manifestation,

9176
06:05:57,680 --> 06:06:05,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would also like to raise the seeming inequitable regional allocation of DPWH projects.

9177
06:06:05,680 --> 06:06:09,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napapansin ko po kung saan po nangangailangan ng infrastruktura.

9178
06:06:09,680 --> 06:06:12,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yun po yata yung kukonti ang budget.

9179
06:06:12,680 --> 06:06:15,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi dapat puro sa malalaking siyudad lamang po ang proyekto.

9180
06:06:15,680 --> 06:06:17,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakitsilip niyo lang po ito.

9181
06:06:17,680 --> 06:06:21,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mga probinsya, mga rural communities.

9182
06:06:21,680 --> 06:06:26,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito pong mga geographically isolated and disadvantaged areas.

9183
06:06:26,680 --> 06:06:31,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And particularly Mindanao and the Visayas.

9184
06:06:31,680 --> 06:06:37,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po magkaroon sila ng fair share of infrastructure investments.

9185
06:06:37,680 --> 06:06:45,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maalala niyo po nun, Sec. Vince, yun pong parating sinasabi ni former President Duterte.

9186
06:06:45,680 --> 06:06:49,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nung kakaupulang niya bilang presidente,

9187
06:06:49,680 --> 06:06:59,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: meron kasi mga gobernador na meron mga proyektong inaprobohan ng previous administration pa

9188
06:06:59,680 --> 06:07:03,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: during the time of former President Aquino.

9189
06:07:03,680 --> 06:07:07,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So napagtungtong nung panahon ni President Duterte, nung 2016,

9190
06:07:07,680 --> 06:07:12,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nag-alala yung mga governor. Sabi nila baka hindi na ipagpatuloy itong mga proyektong ito.

9191
06:07:12,680 --> 06:07:14,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil may lugar na talo si President Duterte.

9192
06:07:15,680 --> 06:07:18,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit sa Mindanao, alam niyo na po yun.

9193
06:07:18,680 --> 06:07:22,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung isang tulayo doon na laking tulong po na iikot ka po.

9194
06:07:22,680 --> 06:07:24,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung pang...

9195
06:07:24,680 --> 06:07:26,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: How do you call that? Pangil?

9196
06:07:26,680 --> 06:07:28,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pangil or pangil?

9197
06:07:28,680 --> 06:07:29,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pangil.

9198
06:07:29,680 --> 06:07:31,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pangil.

9199
06:07:33,680 --> 06:07:34,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pangil Bay, di ba?

9200
06:07:34,680 --> 06:07:38,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maalala niyo, laking tulong po itong proyektong ito.

9201
06:07:38,680 --> 06:07:44,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: From 3 hours na iikot ka, Osamis going to Lanao del Norte.

9202
06:07:44,680 --> 06:07:46,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngayon po, 15 minutes na lang po.

9203
06:07:46,680 --> 06:07:50,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So nag-worry yung mga opisyalis noon na baka hindi ipagpatuloy.

9204
06:07:50,680 --> 06:07:56,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi ni President Duterte nung 2016. Sabi niya, ipagpatuloy niya lahat.

9205
06:07:56,680 --> 06:08:00,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Presidente na ako. Presidente ako ng buong Pilipinas.

9206
06:08:00,680 --> 06:08:02,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat pantay-pantay.

9207
06:08:02,680 --> 06:08:05,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At pantay-pantay yung distribution ng mga proyekto.

9208
06:08:05,680 --> 06:08:11,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: From Region 1 to Region 13 hanggang BARM.

9209
06:08:11,680 --> 06:08:13,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At siya mismo pinuntahan yan. Even sa Ilocos.

9210
06:08:13,680 --> 06:08:17,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi niya, gusto ko pantay-pantay yung mga proyekto.

9211
06:08:17,680 --> 06:08:27,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang mga binisita natin noon. Sana po'y huwag lang po malimutan rin po ang Mindanao at ang Visayas rin po.

9212
06:08:27,680 --> 06:08:32,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sa BARM, salamat po. Ibig sabihin, huwag mo namang kalimutan doon.

9213
06:08:32,680 --> 06:08:33,680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In fact, Wins, ha?

9214
